{"id": "EUVD-2026-96984", "enisaUuid": "c8410a0d-6851-3b12-9c30-99617f4bb03b", "description": "NornicDB through 1.4.1 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows authenticated users to bypass per-database read restrictions on the /nornicdb/search and /nornicdb/similar endpoints. Viewer-role users allowlisted for a database but denied read can submit search queries or node IDs to retrieve node IDs, labels and full property maps.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T12:19:24", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:09:09", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind/orneryd-nornicdb-vector-endpoints-per-db-read-bypass", "https://github.com/orneryd/NornicDB/blob/67105489e6da00714b998faf9012ffa44f526245/pkg/server/server_nornicdb.go#L415-L419", "https://github.com/orneryd/NornicDB/blob/67105489e6da00714b998faf9012ffa44f526245/pkg/server/server_nornicdb.go#L811-L815", "https://github.com/orneryd/NornicDB/blob/67105489e6da00714b998faf9012ffa44f526245/pkg/server/server_graph.go#L418-L423", "https://github.com/orneryd/NornicDB", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/nornicdb-through-1.4.1-missing-authorization-via-vector-search-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108710", "GHSA-vqw4-fq22-hj9c"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.35, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "53c2dc8c-3c7d-3595-8110-be0f2ebe3a88", "product": {"name": "NornicDB", "vendor": {"name": "orneryd"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.4.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "124fceb6-0c3a-394e-a577-cf3594b70f77", "vendor": {"name": "orneryd"}}], "isExploited": false}